### ───────────────────────────────────────────────
### CertifyTube Backend — HTTP Test File
### Open in IntelliJ IDEA → Run individual requests
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### Variables (set your token after login)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1. Signup
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 3. Get current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
### YOUTUBE SEARCH
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5. Search videos
GET {{host}}/api/youtube/search?q=spring%20boot&limit=5

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
### SESSIONS
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 6. Start session
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/start
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "videoId": "dQw4w9WgXcQ",
  "videoTitle": "Test Video"
}

### 7. End session (replace SESSION_ID)
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/end?sessionId=SESSION_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
### EVENTS
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 8. Send event batch
POST {{host}}/api/events/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

[
  {
    "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
    "eventType": "play",
    "playerState": 1,
    "playbackRate": 1.0,
    "currentTimeSec": 0.0,
    "videoDurationSec": 600.0,
    "clientEventMs": 1000
  },
  {
    "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
    "eventType": "pause",
    "playerState": 2,
    "playbackRate": 1.0,
    "currentTimeSec": 120.5,
    "videoDurationSec": 600.0,
    "clientEventMs": 121500
  },
  {
    "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
    "eventType": "play",
    "playerState": 1,
    "playbackRate": 1.0,
    "currentTimeSec": 120.5,
    "videoDurationSec": 600.0,
    "clientEventMs": 125000
  },
  {
    "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
    "eventType": "seek",
    "playerState": 1,
    "playbackRate": 1.0,
    "currentTimeSec": 300.0,
    "videoDurationSec": 600.0,
    "seekFromSec": 120.5,
    "seekToSec": 300.0,
    "clientEventMs": 130000
  },
  {
    "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
    "eventType": "ended",
    "playerState": 0,
    "playbackRate": 1.0,
    "currentTimeSec": 580.0,
    "videoDurationSec": 600.0,
    "clientEventMs": 400000
  }
]

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ANALYZE
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 9a. Analyze session (XGBoost — default)
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/SESSION_ID_HERE/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9b. Analyze session (EBM)
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/SESSION_ID_HERE/analyze?model=ebm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
### QUIZ
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 10. Check quiz eligibility
GET {{host}}/api/quiz/eligibility?sessionId=SESSION_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Generate quiz
POST {{host}}/api/quiz/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_HERE",
  "difficulty": "medium"
}

### 12. Get quiz
GET {{host}}/api/quiz/QUIZ_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Submit quiz answers
POST {{host}}/api/quiz/QUIZ_ID_HERE/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "answers": {
    "q1": "A",
    "q2": "B",
    "q3": "true",
    "q4": "C",
    "q5": "D"
  }
}

### 14. Get quiz result
GET {{host}}/api/quiz/QUIZ_ID_HERE/result
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
### CERTIFICATES
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 15. Get certificate (owner only)
GET {{host}}/api/certificates/CERTIFICATE_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Download certificate PDF
GET {{host}}/api/certificates/CERTIFICATE_ID_HERE/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Public verify certificate
GET {{host}}/api/certificates/verify/VERIFICATION_TOKEN_HERE

### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ADMIN (requires ADMIN role)
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 18. Admin: Get stats
GET {{host}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Admin: List all users
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Admin: Get user by ID
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Admin: Update user role
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/users/1/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 22. Admin: Delete user
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Admin: List sessions
GET {{host}}/api/admin/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. Admin: Delete session
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/sessions/SESSION_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. Admin: List certificates
GET {{host}}/api/admin/certificates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. Admin: Delete certificate
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/certificates/CERT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 27. Admin: List quizzes
GET {{host}}/api/admin/quizzes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28. Admin: Delete quiz
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/quizzes/QUIZ_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
